// Grounded Brain: source status lifecycle
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code
title Source status lifecycle
direction right
colorMode bold

Start [shape: oval, color: gray, label: "start"]
PENDING [color: gray]
PROCESSING [color: blue]
READY [color: green]
FAILED [color: red]
Deleted [shape: oval, color: gray, label: "deleted"]

Start > PENDING: created / reprocess requested
PENDING > PROCESSING: Inngest job starts
PROCESSING > READY: chunks embedded and indexed
PROCESSING > FAILED: step failed after retries
FAILED > PENDING: reprocess
READY > PENDING: reprocess
READY > Deleted: deleted
